OL,3,ABystander who tackled suspect after
OL,4,AAustralian MP attacked with car said he
OL,5,Ahad 'no choice'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe suspect has been named by local
OL,8,Fmedia as Brendan Nugent, who was
OL,9,Fpreviously well known in the local area
OL,10,Fas an environmental campaigner
OL,12,FPolice say it was an "isolated
OL,13,Fincident" and they are working to
OL,14,Fidentify potential charges
OL,16,FFloral tributes are piling up at
OL,17,FHaines' office in the town of
OL,18,FWangaratta, where a vigil has been held
OL,19,Ffor the 65-year-old independent MP
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
