OL,3,APolls close as voters in Alberta decide
OL,4,Awhether to have referendum on leaving
OL,5,ACanada
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolls have closed as voters in Alberta
OL,8,Fare deciding whether to have a
OL,9,Freferendum on separating from Canada
OL,11,F"I don't even consider myself to be
OL,12,FCanadian anymore," one voter tells the
OL,13,FBBC, while another calls the vote "a
OL,14,Fturning point in Canada's history"
OL,16,FSeparatists argue the province - which
OL,17,Fhas the fourth-largest oil reserves in
OL,18,Fthe world - has been overlooked by
OL,19,FOttawa
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
